String str= "this is a test string";

solution: 

1: optimal 
make a freq array [256]  O(1) 
loop and add in freq []   O(n) 
loop and from reverse to get the last repeating freq O(n)

int [] frequency = new int [256]; 

for(char c : str.toCharArray() ){
    freq[c]++;  // char will be converted to int // similarly if array of char is there and we add int it will be converted to char
}

for(int i=str.length-1; i>=0; i--) {
  if( freq[ str.charAt(i) > 1) {
      return str.charAt(i);
  }

}


